# A variant's maximum hand size is the player's before any effect sets one (CR 402.2, 902.5b); an effect that says
# otherwise replaces it, as it replaces the normal seven. Bot1's variant maximum is three, but Reliquary Tower, played on
# turn one, says Bot1 has no maximum hand size: Bot1 keeps all six cards at its cleanup step. Bot2's variant maximum of
# four stands with no effect to change it, and Bot2 discards down to four on turn two.

[Bot1 Deck]
Reliquary Tower
Forest x39

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x40

[Variant]
Bot1: maximum 3
Bot2: maximum 4

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Reliquary Tower.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Reliquary Tower
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Hand.Count = 4
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 4
